<title>UK: Both Brent cargoes kept - trade.</title>
<headline>Both Brent cargoes kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both Brent cargoes which turned wet on Tuesday were kept before the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargoes -- due to load in the January 29-31 period -- were kept by Shell U.K. and Tosco.</p>
<p>-- Siobhan Hayden, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
